-margin text-uppercase">Primary Holding</strong>
	<p>
			=09
		A district court=E2=80=99s erroneous dismissal of a non-diverse party bef=
ore final judgment cannot cure a jurisdictional defect that existed when th=
e case was removed to federal court.		=09
	</p>
